Modifications on 2026-10-19: the previously researched portability patch is
applied to three vendor source files; the original patch is retained beside
SOURCE.json. New code adds a C ABI, serialized initialization/search, canonical
input validation, current-to-target composition, an independent geometric
facelet verifier, desktop build integration and regression fixtures/tests.
HTTP, networking, file cache and upstream example code are not part of the
linked library. Source hashes are recorded in SOURCE.json.

The facelet coordinate conventions in the independent verifier follow the
existing TrainTimer src/cube-state.js implementation. Test fixture data is an
unaltered copy of the project's 2026-10-18 solver research dataset (seed
20261018); it is included for reproducible current-to-target regression.

